# Supabase PostgreSQL Pooler URL (or direct DATABASE_URL):
# Format: postgresql://postgres.ckhptmuwzevswvzvtcba:[YOUR-PASSWORD]@aws-0-ap-south-1.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
